    {
        "content": "<p>It looks to me like the PrimeNumberTheorem is the only project under this section, or does the + imply there are others?  Is the section only for public group efforts? (very cool idea to globally crowdsource!)</p>",
        "id": 597326797,
        "sender_full_name": "Ian Allen",
        "timestamp": 1779558672
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This is pretty well documented online, unless I misunderstood your question.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ubv1Qmy1UT0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ubv1Qmy1UT0</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4BWq891OEc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4BWq891OEc</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://alexkontorovich.github.io/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/blueprint/\">https://alexkontorovich.github.io/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd/blueprint/</a><br>\n<a class=\"stream\" data-stream-id=\"423402\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/423402-PrimeNumberTheorem.2B\">#PrimeNumberTheorem+</a></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-video message_inline_image\"><a data-id=\"ubv1Qmy1UT0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ubv1Qmy1UT0\"><img src=\"https://uploads.zulipusercontent.net/81684c401a88a2a207a18b3547900e987d3eae7e/68747470733a2f2f692e7974696d672e636f6d2f76692f75627631516d79315554302f6d7164656661756c742e6a7067\"></a></div><div class=\"youtube-video message_inline_image\"><a data-id=\"c4BWq891OEc\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4BWq891OEc\"><img src=\"https://uploads.zulipusercontent.net/3c8db9e158133cc8a5ae193146ddf3b5dcb50c96/68747470733a2f2f692e7974696d672e636f6d2f76692f63344257713839314f45632f6d7164656661756c742e6a7067\"></a></div>",
        "id": 597327189,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
